"""
Atelier PDM - help and manual content (atelier_help_text.py)  2.9.5
===================================================================
One source for the Help window (F1) and the PDF manual. Each chapter is a list of blocks:
    ("h", "Section")   heading        ("p", "Text")     paragraph      ("b", "Text")   bullet
    ("n", "Text")      numbered step  ("note", "Text")  note box       ("warn", "Text") important box
    ("t", [[cells], ...])  table (first row = headings)
Inside text, **bold** and `code` are recognised.
"""

